WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.740 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:56.420 --> 02:00.680
Are you lonely? You poor girl...

02:00.680 --> 02:02.310
Akiko...

02:06.680 --> 02:07.940
<i>Papa...</i>

02:08.810 --> 02:10.940
<i>Hey... Please...</i>

02:11.900 --> 02:13.690
<i>Take a picture...</i>

02:15.030 --> 02:16.610
<i>Take beautiful pictures...</i>

02:18.320 --> 02:20.450
<i>Just for me...</i>

02:21.490 --> 02:25.120
<i>Take lots of pictures...</i>

02:25.120 --> 02:27.910
<i>Use those beautiful pictures as decoration.</i>

02:27.910 --> 02:31.790
<i>Then I will be able to live with you again!</i>

02:32.380 --> 02:34.050
I understand, Akiko.

02:34.050 --> 02:39.340
I will take many beautiful pictures, and we'll live together again...

02:40.640 --> 02:42.720
Like we used to...

02:48.060 --> 02:50.020
Akiko...!

03:14.340 --> 03:16.460
I can't, Akiko.

03:16.460 --> 03:19.420
The most beautiful pictures were with you as the model.

03:19.420 --> 03:22.470
How can I take beautiful pictures anymore?

03:41.320 --> 03:42.700
Akiko...

03:43.490 --> 03:45.700
Papa, take it...

03:46.990 --> 03:49.660
You want me to take pictures of her?

03:54.670 --> 04:01.300
Heartless <i>Checkmate</i>

04:01.300 --> 04:04.680
One, two, three!

04:07.140 --> 04:09.970
Gather around, everyone!

04:11.560 --> 04:13.810
I want to introduce you all to...

04:13.810 --> 04:16.690
...a photographer named Saegusa Yasushi.

04:17.650 --> 04:19.030
Good afternoon.

04:19.030 --> 04:20.940
Saegusa Yasushi?

04:20.940 --> 04:21.780
You know him?

04:21.780 --> 04:23.530
You don't know who he is?

04:23.530 --> 04:26.070
He's Japan's most famous photographer.

04:27.030 --> 04:32.250
He owns a house in this city and was just visiting.

04:32.250 --> 04:35.580
He contacted me about wanting to take pictures of all of you.

04:35.580 --> 04:37.500
That's amazing!

04:37.500 --> 04:38.670
What is?

04:38.670 --> 04:39.670
What do you mean "What is?"

04:39.670 --> 04:45.470
Every girl that ever modelled for him has made a debut as an actress.

04:45.470 --> 04:52.680
<i>And</i> his pictures are sold not only in Japan but worldwide!

04:52.680 --> 04:57.730
There was also a girl who was scouted by a Hollywood producer!

04:58.650 --> 05:00.360
Sold worldwide...

05:01.530 --> 05:06.530
<i>Maybe pictures of me will be seen by Papa and Mama!</i>

05:07.700 --> 05:10.330
But I wonder what he's been doing?

05:10.330 --> 05:14.290
He hasn't released any work for the last three years.

05:15.370 --> 05:18.920
Sorry fo the delay. Please bear with me.

05:18.920 --> 05:22.340
Okay, everyone! Practice!

05:29.470 --> 05:31.510
How beautiful.

05:35.890 --> 05:38.730
Akiko, is this what you want?

05:41.070 --> 05:43.030
It's so very beautiful.

05:45.400 --> 05:46.950
Akiko.

05:58.830 --> 06:00.670
Sensei, are you okay?

06:01.790 --> 06:05.050
Thank you. I'm fine.

06:05.670 --> 06:09.140
<i>His face looks as though a Demon has possessed his soul.</i>

06:09.140 --> 06:10.510
Maron!

06:10.510 --> 06:13.930
What are you spacing out for?! Let's carry him to the Nurse's Office!

06:20.940 --> 06:22.480
Will he be okay?

06:22.480 --> 06:25.820
-I think so. He just needs some rest.

06:24.320 --> 06:25.820
- Yo! You guys going home now?

06:25.820 --> 06:27.400
Ah! Chiaki!

06:28.910 --> 06:30.700
Chiaki, big news!

06:30.700 --> 06:34.580
That photographer, Saegusa Yasushi, came to take pictures of us!

06:34.580 --> 06:36.790
Saegusa Yasushi the famous photographer?

06:36.790 --> 06:40.000
Wow, that's cool. I want to meet him. Introduce me to him.

06:40.000 --> 06:44.170
He suddenly got sick and went home.

06:46.090 --> 06:49.470
Ah, I see... And so, Maron didn't get her picture taken and went off pouting?

06:49.470 --> 06:52.550
Eh? What are you talking about?

06:52.550 --> 06:56.430
He got sick while taking pictures of me.

06:56.430 --> 06:58.350
I think I understand why...

06:58.350 --> 07:00.020
What did you say?!

07:00.020 --> 07:02.190
Hey! Wait right there!!!

07:07.320 --> 07:08.570
Kusakabe-san...

07:08.570 --> 07:11.490
Sensei, I thought you went home.

07:11.490 --> 07:16.910
Yes, I did go home. However, I forgot to thank you guys, so...

07:16.910 --> 07:19.460
You didn't have to bother.

07:19.460 --> 07:21.710
Could I have a minute with you guys?

07:22.500 --> 07:23.290
But...

07:23.290 --> 07:24.750
We'd be happy to!

07:24.750 --> 07:27.380
Excuse me, can I come along, too?

07:27.380 --> 07:29.130
Of course.

07:29.130 --> 07:30.170
Hop in.

07:30.630 --> 07:32.010
Lucky!

07:33.090 --> 07:34.680
What a shameless girl...

07:35.390 --> 07:37.260
What a beautiful place.

07:38.060 --> 07:41.140
I've always wanted to come here.

07:41.140 --> 07:43.690
You can order anything you want.

07:43.690 --> 07:45.110
All right!

07:45.110 --> 07:46.940
What do you want, Chiaki?

07:46.940 --> 07:50.860
Miyako! Restrain yourself a little!

07:50.860 --> 07:53.490
It's okay to be energetic.

07:53.490 --> 07:54.570
Umm...

07:54.570 --> 07:56.780
What would you like, Kusakabe-san?

07:56.780 --> 07:59.370
Are you feeling all right now?

07:59.370 --> 08:02.420
I'm sorry for making you worry.

08:02.420 --> 08:05.540
I'm all right now. I'm just getting a little too old.

08:05.540 --> 08:06.630
That's not true...

08:06.630 --> 08:10.630
I need to take more beautiful pictures.

08:10.630 --> 08:14.430
You "need to" take more pictures? Is there a reason?

08:14.430 --> 08:16.970
Actually, can I ask you a favor?

08:17.890 --> 08:20.600
Will you become a model for my pictures?

08:21.520 --> 08:23.190
Me? A model?

08:23.190 --> 08:25.060
Please, will you do it?

08:25.060 --> 08:27.230
A model...

08:28.270 --> 08:33.110
<i>Maybe pictures of me will be seen by Papa and Mama!</i>

08:33.990 --> 08:37.070
Can I really be a model?

08:37.070 --> 08:39.580
I have time to be a model, too!

08:39.580 --> 08:41.410
It has to be you!

08:50.550 --> 08:52.670
Umm, I'm sorry.

08:52.670 --> 08:57.140
To tell you the truth, you look exactly like my deceased daughter.

08:57.140 --> 08:58.640
Like your daughter?

08:58.640 --> 09:02.680
There was an accident three years ago.

09:02.680 --> 09:05.600
She was living with me...

09:06.520 --> 09:08.230
<i>He's lonely, too.</i>

09:10.110 --> 09:11.690
It's all in the past.

09:11.690 --> 09:14.030
Please don't worry about it too much.

09:41.140 --> 09:42.220
I accept!

09:43.140 --> 09:46.310
But I'll eat a lot in payment!

09:46.310 --> 09:48.150
Ha ha ha, go ahead!

09:48.150 --> 09:49.860
You should restrain yourself, too!

09:49.860 --> 09:52.400
Tell that to yourself!

09:52.400 --> 09:53.820
I dare you to say that again!!!

09:56.950 --> 09:59.450
I am Fin-chan!

09:59.450 --> 10:01.330
A Semi-Angel!

10:01.330 --> 10:02.740
I'm really cute...

10:03.700 --> 10:06.660
I feel sick. What's this feeling?

10:06.660 --> 10:08.670
Could it be a Demon?

10:11.460 --> 10:12.880
Inside that house?

10:19.640 --> 10:22.100
I wonder where it's hiding.

10:22.680 --> 10:24.600
That large picture is so beautiful.

10:25.600 --> 10:27.430
It's probably hiding in there.

10:28.390 --> 10:30.350
Ohhh...my head!

10:36.570 --> 10:37.650
Fin-chan!

10:37.650 --> 10:39.950
Fin-chan, are you...?

10:44.120 --> 10:45.740
I...

10:48.620 --> 10:49.960
Fin-chan, are you--

10:51.880 --> 10:53.420
...awake now...?

10:54.460 --> 10:57.670
Access! Were you following me around?!

10:57.670 --> 11:01.510
You're mistaken! I was just flying around when you came falling down!

11:01.510 --> 11:02.800
You liar!

11:02.800 --> 11:05.760
I won't be fooled by what a servant of the Devil says!

11:05.760 --> 11:08.350
I'm telling you that I'm not a servant of the Devil!

11:08.350 --> 11:10.980
So, there is a Demon in that house!

11:10.980 --> 11:13.400
I won't let the Devil have it!

11:13.400 --> 11:14.730
A Demon?

11:14.730 --> 11:16.610
In that house?

11:32.370 --> 11:33.790
You deserved that!

11:36.170 --> 11:38.010
I have to tell Maron!

11:42.340 --> 11:44.970
Notice

11:42.340 --> 11:44.970
Don't go away!

11:42.340 --> 11:44.970
I'll return right after these messages!

11:42.340 --> 11:44.970
Kaitou Jeanne

11:45.850 --> 11:48.430
Notice

11:45.850 --> 11:48.430
I'm back to continue my adventures

11:45.850 --> 11:48.430
Kaitou Jeanne

11:53.520 --> 11:55.650
Maron!!!

11:57.980 --> 12:01.400
What?! A Demon is in the house of Sunset Cliff?

12:01.400 --> 12:05.490
I'm sure of it. It's the house of a man named Saegusa Yasushi.

12:05.490 --> 12:09.660
Saegusa-sensei's house? Why didn't you tell me earlier?

12:09.660 --> 12:12.750
I just got back!

12:12.750 --> 12:16.380
I'm sure Sinbad will come, too, since I saw Access sniffing around.

12:17.130 --> 12:19.590
Saegusa-sensei... A Demon...?

12:22.050 --> 12:25.180
<i>There was an accident three years ago...</i>

12:28.060 --> 12:29.890
I've got to do something.

12:29.890 --> 12:32.100
Fin, what about the notice?

12:32.100 --> 12:33.850
I've already sent it.

12:33.850 --> 12:35.150
What time?

12:35.150 --> 12:36.940
Midnight.

12:37.940 --> 12:42.860
I've got to somehow <i>Checkmate</i> and save him before Miyako or Sinbad get in my way.

12:43.570 --> 12:46.490
Maron seems so intense today...

12:46.490 --> 12:48.490
Fin, let's go!

12:48.490 --> 12:49.790
Okay.

13:05.380 --> 13:08.180
Kaitou Jeanne is going to come?

13:11.100 --> 13:13.770
What is she coming for?!

13:13.770 --> 13:16.100
It can't be you, Akiko? Has she targeted you?!

13:16.690 --> 13:19.190
Akiko, say something...

13:20.440 --> 13:23.190
Akiko, please...

13:23.190 --> 13:25.070
<i>A little more, Papa...</i>

13:25.530 --> 13:26.860
Akiko...

13:26.860 --> 13:32.410
<i>We can live together if you take some more beautiful pictures.</i>

13:33.870 --> 13:37.790
Really? We can live together soon?

13:41.380 --> 13:43.460
I understand, Akiko...

13:46.260 --> 13:49.220
I won't tell the police about this.

13:54.810 --> 13:57.690
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

14:09.620 --> 14:11.580
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

14:11.580 --> 14:13.490
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

14:13.490 --> 14:14.950
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

14:44.110 --> 14:45.570
That's weird.

14:46.360 --> 14:47.990
Miyako and the others aren't here...

14:49.070 --> 14:51.530
Be careful, it may be a trap.

14:51.530 --> 14:52.030
I know.

15:04.420 --> 15:05.500
I can't see anything.

15:05.500 --> 15:06.960
Jeanne!<i></i>

15:06.960 --> 15:10.050
The Demon might not be inside.

15:10.050 --> 15:12.470
That's why you should check outside carefully before going in...

15:12.470 --> 15:15.970
I don't have time for that! If I don't hurry, Sensei's life...

15:15.970 --> 15:18.060
Jeanne! Jeanne!!!

15:29.610 --> 15:31.490
The Demon is in here.

15:42.830 --> 15:44.590
Are you Jeanne?

15:45.210 --> 15:47.000
Saegusa-sensei...

15:47.340 --> 15:51.880
Please, I'll give you anything you want...

15:51.880 --> 15:53.970
So leave Akiko...

15:53.970 --> 15:56.180
Leave my Akiko alone...

15:57.310 --> 15:58.930
Please don't take it...

16:00.640 --> 16:01.810
This is...

16:22.410 --> 16:24.790
Which one of these is the Demon living in?

16:24.790 --> 16:26.420
Please...

16:26.420 --> 16:31.300
Please, I'll be able to live with Akiko soon!

16:31.300 --> 16:33.840
Live with her? You can't.

16:33.840 --> 16:36.050
One of these pictures is possessed by a Demon.

16:36.050 --> 16:39.720
You're about to be consumed by it.

16:39.720 --> 16:41.730
That's why you can't get in my way.

16:41.730 --> 16:43.480
In the name of God...

16:44.020 --> 16:46.650
You, a Demon, born in--

16:47.270 --> 16:48.480
Please stop!

16:48.480 --> 16:51.650
It's the only way to save you. Otherwise, you might die!

16:51.650 --> 16:54.910
I don't need to be saved. I'm not afraid to die!

16:54.910 --> 16:57.200
As long as I can be near Akiko.

17:00.330 --> 17:03.250
No! You have to live for your daughter's sake!

17:03.250 --> 17:05.830
In the name of God...

17:06.540 --> 17:09.500
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

17:10.670 --> 17:12.260
I seal you here!

17:13.050 --> 17:13.720
Stop!!!

17:15.680 --> 17:16.890
The pin!

17:16.890 --> 17:19.350
Don't get in my way!

17:24.140 --> 17:26.520
Kaitou Sinbad has arrived.

17:27.520 --> 17:29.150
Sinbad...

17:29.150 --> 17:32.940
Have you also come to take my Akiko away from me?!

17:39.120 --> 17:42.080
Stop, Sinbad! What are you doing?!

17:42.080 --> 17:45.330
I only came to collect the Demon.

17:45.330 --> 17:47.790
I won't let anyone stand in my way.

17:51.040 --> 17:52.500
What?!

17:58.140 --> 17:59.640
Where is the Demon?!

18:01.100 --> 18:02.600
Please stop...

18:02.600 --> 18:04.680
Please!

18:04.680 --> 18:06.890
Hey! Where's the Demon?!

18:07.440 --> 18:10.110
Don't hurt him! He's only--

18:10.110 --> 18:10.980
Get out of my way.

18:15.490 --> 18:17.360
What are you trying to pull, Jeanne?

18:17.360 --> 18:21.620
This man is about to die from being possessed by a Demon!

18:21.620 --> 18:24.200
I won't forgive you for hurting a man who is suffering!

18:24.200 --> 18:28.710
I'm disappointed in you. Didn't you come to seal the Demon?

18:28.710 --> 18:30.080
That is...

18:30.080 --> 18:35.510
Isn't sealing the Demon the only way to eliminate his suffering?

18:49.690 --> 18:50.400
You're naive...

18:54.020 --> 18:55.320
Much too naive!!!

18:57.490 --> 19:02.530
I have no time to play with naive people like you...

19:02.530 --> 19:04.370
...who hesitate in their missions!

19:08.410 --> 19:10.750
Please stop!

19:13.540 --> 19:14.750
Out of the way!

19:20.340 --> 19:21.510
What are you doing?!

19:22.390 --> 19:27.270
I'll have to burn these since I don't know where the Demon is hiding.

19:28.350 --> 19:28.980
What?!

19:30.190 --> 19:31.230
Stop!

19:33.650 --> 19:35.400
A-A-Akiko!!

19:35.400 --> 19:37.480
Akiko will...!

19:38.110 --> 19:39.610
How cruel!

19:39.610 --> 19:43.820
Please stop! Don't hurt my Akiko!

19:44.660 --> 19:46.030
Where's the Demon?

20:08.390 --> 20:09.560
Shit!

20:14.100 --> 20:15.400
Saegusa-sensei!

20:15.400 --> 20:16.480
Where's the Demon?!

20:22.570 --> 20:23.610
That sound...

20:33.080 --> 20:35.750
I see now. The Demon possessed the camera!

20:37.210 --> 20:38.130
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:49.560 --> 20:51.770
Way to go, Sinbad!

20:51.770 --> 20:53.690
Let's go, Access.

20:53.690 --> 20:54.730
Sure thing!

20:55.190 --> 20:57.020
Wait, Sinbad!

20:57.020 --> 20:59.860
The Demon wasn't inside the pictures!

20:59.860 --> 21:05.450
You needlessly burnt Saegusa-sensei's pictures of his beloved daughter!

21:07.030 --> 21:10.660
I will seal the Demon in any way I can.

21:10.660 --> 21:11.910
That's my mission...

21:13.210 --> 21:15.210
Jeanne, isn't it yours too?!

21:18.460 --> 21:22.590
I... I...

21:26.550 --> 21:29.640
You're unfit for this job.

21:32.520 --> 21:37.230
You're too naive.

21:39.940 --> 21:41.190
What was that?

21:41.190 --> 21:45.110
I don't need the Devil's servant...

21:45.110 --> 21:47.070
...to tell me what to do!

21:51.450 --> 21:53.160
Jeanne...

21:53.160 --> 21:54.500
Unforgivable...!

21:55.790 --> 21:59.920
The end doesn't always justify the means!

21:59.920 --> 22:04.970
I can't forgive the way Sinbad does his job!

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.010 --> 23:34.100
Class President, it feels like you've changed a lot...

23:34.100 --> 23:37.180
Yeah, and it's all thanks to Maron.

23:37.180 --> 23:40.730
Don't you like me being a super-elite who can do anything?

23:40.730 --> 23:43.690
Class President, haven't you realized that you're like a puppet on a string?

23:43.690 --> 23:47.530
You're not the Class President that I used to know. You're a fake!

23:47.530 --> 23:50.740
You're wrong, this is the real me!

23:50.740 --> 23:55.330
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: The Masked Man! Who Is the Real One?

23:55.330 --> 23:59.200
Kaitou Jeanne will uncover this fake mask...
